    Journal "You are sinful. You need to get punished by [Guard] Cabal."
    Kill 10 of 9313 at direction_1068
    Kill 10 of 9314 at direction_1069
    Kill 10 of 9315 at direction_1070
    Kill 10 of 9316 at direction_1071

Requires player level >= 1 and quest 813 is completed

Rewards none

direction_1068 = location "Bandicoot" about "Bandicoot\nA rodent which grew abnormally by feeding on corpses of people from the War with Pathos." found "Prison" at 0 0 in zone 92
direction_1069 = location "Kecoon" about "Kecoon\nA reptile, walking on two feet from the War with Pathos." found "Prison" at 0 0 in zone 92
direction_1070 = location "Bulcan" about "Bulcan\nMonster of Moradon which creates Iron Ore from earth in its stomach. " found "Prison" at 0 0 in zone 92
direction_1071 = location "Gavolt" about "Gavolt\nBird type monster that transformed by Pathos' evil power." found "Prison" at 0 0 in zone 92

On offer
    Say "You have been brought to the jail for using [Hack Tool]. You can go back to Moradon when you have completed the punishments here."
    Topic "Confirm" do
        Show quest "Follow [Guard] Cabal's order and catch [Bandikut], [Caegoon], [Vulkan], [Gabolt]."

On in_progress
    Say "Please thoroughly complete the mission to leave the jail."

On completed
    Say "Mission completed. If you even come back here again, you will get harsher punishment. Keep in mind and try not to come back here ever again."
    Topic "Oh, right." do
        Teleport 21 at 817 448
